### Add a list of time tracking projects to a project
PATCH {{BASE_URL}}/projects/1/time
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time_tracking_projects": [
    {
      "name": "wakatime project",
      "provider": "wakatime"
    },
    {
      "name": "hackatime project",
      "provider": "hackatime"
    }
  ]
}

###